==Related Quests==
Although there are a handful of quests associated with the Bards College, it does not have a true quest line. For example, there is no [[Skyrim:Quests#Knotwork|knotwork]] specific to the Bards College, your game statistics do not have a separate category for tracking these quests, and there are no [[Skyrim:achievements|achievements]] for entering the college or finishing its quests. The following quests are instead categorized as a [[Skyrim:Side Quests|side quest]] and several [[Skyrim:Miscellaneous Quests|miscellaneous quests]]:

